{"title": "Organ Rearranger", "pageid": 28085, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Organ_Rearranger", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Organ Rearranger</b> is a passive feature that makes its wielder more deadly.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Reduce the number you need to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking by 1. This effect can stack. When you roll 2 damage or less, reroll the dice, taking the highest result. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_TheClover_Rearrangement_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_TheClover_Rearrangement_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_TheClover_Rearrangement_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\">Knife of the Undermountain King</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Clover\" title=\"The Clover\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/The_Clover_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Clover\" title=\"The Clover\">The Clover</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Organ Rearranger stacks with other passive effects that improve critical chance, including ranged attacks and spell attack rolls <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/BaldursGate3/comments/16yt4g0/psa_organ_rearranger_and_what_it_applies_to/\">[1]</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/BaldursGate3/comments/1662vcv/knife_of_the_undermountain_king_other_crit_easier/\">[2]</a>.</li>\n<li>Organ Rearranger's damage reroll is only applied to melee weapon attacks. When dual-wielding melee weapons, both weapons will benefit.\n<ul><li>All damage dice attached to an attack can be rerolled, not just the weapon's base damage die.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The damage reroll is <i>not normally</i> applied to any other attack type, including <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">throw</a> attacks using the Knife of the Undermountain King itself.\n<ul><li>However, Organ Rearranger's damage reroll <i>does stack with itself</i> (via a second <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\">Knife of the Undermountain King</a> due to the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/King%27s_Knife\" title=\"King's Knife\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Kings_Knife_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/King%27s_Knife\" title=\"King's Knife\">King's Knife</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invoke_Duplicity\" title=\"Invoke Duplicity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/20px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/30px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/40px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invoke Duplicity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp/20px-Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Invoke_Duplicity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invoke_Duplicity\" title=\"Invoke Duplicity\">Invoke Duplicity</a> bugs) or dual wielding with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune\" title=\"Twist of Fortune\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Morningstar_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Twist_of_Fortune\" title=\"Twist of Fortune\">Twist of Fortune</a>. The improvement of the second reroll is smaller than the first one.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2880/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30111/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11387/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1150912/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.658      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   63.658      1 -total\n 36.35%   23.137      5 Template:Item_icon\n 27.81%   17.704      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 23.10%   14.703      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 21.45%   13.656      2 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 21.36%   13.596      1 Template:Uid\n 19.84%   12.631      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 15.48%    9.857      1 Template:Template_style\n 11.89%    7.566     10 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28085-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200446 and revision id 381716. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}